[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
amdxdna needs kernel support that is not in FreeBSD yet: the LinuxKPI
and AMD IOMMU fixes of the olivier-npu branch of
https://github.com/ocochard/freebsd-src.  The NPU firmware also needs
the AMD IOMMU enabled.  In /boot/loader.conf:

  hw.amdiommu.enable="1"
  hw.amdxdna.carveout_mb="8192"

The carveout is the memory reserved for NPU buffers, in MB: about 1024
for the XRT tests, several GB for language models.  Then load the
driver, or add it to kld_list in /etc/rc.conf:

  kldload amdxdna
EOM
}
]
